1
00:00:00,339 --> 00:00:03,309
(Raj:)Uh, turn left here
and see if he turns with us.

2
00:00:04,377 --> 00:00:06,477
(Penny:)Well, why is
he turning here?

3
00:00:06,479 --> 00:00:08,349
(Penny:)The restaurant's the other way.
I don't know.

4
00:00:08,347 --> 00:00:10,717
(Leonard:)He uses that traffic app.
Maybe there's an accident.

5
00:00:10,716 --> 00:00:12,216
(Penny:)Oh, so follow him.

6
00:00:14,754 --> 00:00:16,024
Oh, no!

7
00:00:18,190 --> 00:00:20,020
I told you!

8
00:00:20,026 --> 00:00:22,626
(Bernadette:)It's probably
just a coincidence.

9
00:00:22,628 --> 00:00:25,258
(Bernadette:)Speed up a little,
see if he stays with you.

10
00:00:25,264 --> 00:00:26,794
(Penny:)Well, go faster.

11
00:00:26,799 --> 00:00:28,169
(Penny:)You're losing him.
What is his hurry?

12
00:00:28,167 --> 00:00:29,467
(Howard:)You know what,
flash your lights.

13
00:00:29,468 --> 00:00:30,738
(Penny:)Let him know it's you.

14
00:00:31,570 --> 00:00:33,070
(Howard:)He's flashing his lights.

15
00:00:33,072 --> 00:00:34,502
(Howard:)What's that mean?

16
00:00:34,507 --> 00:00:36,307
I-I think he wants us
to pull over.

17
00:00:36,309 --> 00:00:37,839
Do not pull over!

18
00:00:37,843 --> 00:00:39,243
I'm not raising this baby alone!

19
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:42,380
Hang on!

20
00:00:42,381 --> 00:00:44,651
(engine revving)

21
00:00:45,851 --> 00:00:48,851
(Alfred:)So, after
your husband passed,

22
00:00:48,854 --> 00:00:50,524
(Alfred:)you never remarried?

23
00:00:50,523 --> 00:00:53,053
(Mary:)No, just focused on work
and the church.

24
00:00:53,059 --> 00:00:54,329
(Alfred:)Ah. And what do you do?

25
00:00:54,327 --> 00:00:56,527
(Mary:)I work at the church.

26
00:00:57,863 --> 00:00:59,833
(Alfred:)Well, they're lucky
to have you.

27
00:00:59,832 --> 00:01:01,802
MARY:
Well, thank you.

